          "type": "SIZE_T"
        },
        {
          "name": "Alignment",
          "type": "UInt",
          "default": "DEFAULT_ALIGNMENT"
        }
      ],
      "returnType": "SIZE_T",
      "docs": "For some allocators this will return the actual size that should be requested to eliminate\ninternal fragmentation. The return value will always be >= Count. This can be used to grow\nand shrink containers to optimal sizes.\nThis call is always fast and threadsafe with no locking."
