      "params": [],
      "returnType": "Void",
      "docs": "Mark TLS caches for current thread as unused. Typically before going to sleep. These are the threads that we can trim without waking them up."
    },
    {
      "id": "test-memory",
      "name": "TestMemory",
      "category": "UnrealMemory",
      "signature": "TestMemory()",
      "params": [],
      "returnType": "Void",
      "docs": "A helper function that will perform a series of random heap allocations to test\nthe internal validity of the heap. Note, this function will \"leak\" memory, but another call\nwill clean up previously allocated blocks before returning. This will help to A/B testing\nwhere you call it in a good state, do something to corrupt memory, then call this again\nand hopefully freeing some pointers will trigger a crash."
    },
